 birds flying around him. Always in anxiety that Nana will leave him.\nNana: 174cm, human boy with rabbit ears and tail. Pokerface, but loves Shiratori very much.（Note that rabbit ears grow on the sides of the head, not on the hat）\n\nTheir relationship: \nLiving together, having a normal daily life. Shiratori occasionally gets upset with worry, and Nana comforts him. Shiratori is always the one taking the initiative, but Nana always looks out for Shiratori. Nana doesn't show any obvious emotion, but he does have a few little gestures to show that he likes Shiratori.\n\nmy request:\nShiratori tries to sneakily touch Nana's rabbit tail, but Nana gets angry and kicks Shiratori out of the house. Please feel free to imagine the composition, movement and costume\n\nYou can cancel the request if you feel it is inappropriate or difficult.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-8sUClf7BVZXNKF5l1AitC3tV76byUh6", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Sada__56/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/fb50990d/uploads/origins/c89f385e-565f-4e3b-a95e-bcd4c56954ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f42a83a2c7acab9db662e8d80b4e9008", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fb50990d/uploads/origins/c89f385e-565f-4e3b-a95e-bcd4c56954ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f42a83a2c7acab9db662e8d80b4e9008, https://si.imgix.net/fb50990d/uploads/origins/c89f385e-565f-4e3b-a95e-bcd4c56954ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ac0e72f439fd3fa07c7526ba2a88573 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fb50990d/uploads/origins/c89f385e-565f-4e3b-a95e-bcd4c56954ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=73015e46a87bfeb9beb1db4d11ab5c6b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私のVtuberキャラの絵を描いてほしいです。かわいいポーズでお願いします。性格は明るく、よく吠える。\n犬種はジャーマンシェパードです。\n\n参考までに。\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E-c50EZXIAMa7EQ?format=jpg&name=la